    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Jaak provides you with drivers in Kuwait to deliver your orders. &#8220;Jaak&#8221; is like &#8220;Uber&#8221;, but for your WooCommerce orders.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Shows you order delivery status directly in WooCommerce order page.</li>\n<li>Shows you the delivery price up-front.</li>\n<li>Groups deliveries based on geographic location to reduce delivery costs.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Install and activate the Jaak plugin.</li>\n<li>Add your Jaak API key.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
